# .gitleaksignore — patterns to exclude from secret scanning.
#
# These files are either gitignored, downloaded data, or false-positive
# triggers from the Catalogue of Life (CoL) raw reference dumps (academic
# references, DOIs, and Wikipedia URLs that happen to look like keys).
#
# .mcp.json — local MCP config containing the Stitch MCP API key (user's
# own Google Cloud API key for the Stitch MCP server). Already gitignored
# and never committed; the key is the user's, not something to rotate.
#
# data/raw/coldp/extracted/* — downloaded CoL reference data (academic
# references, DOIs, Wikipedia URLs with query params, random IDs). The
# strings gitleaks flags are legitimate taxonomic reference text, not
# credentials.

.mcp.json
data/raw/coldp/extracted/
